<tr>
<td style="BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0pt; PADDING-TOP: 0pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.25pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.25pt">
<p><span>施工方案（含工程特点、施工重点与难点及绿色施工）总体安排合理，施工工艺、施工机械合理、可行；对施工难点有合理的建议。</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0pt; PADDING-TOP: 0pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.25pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.25pt">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center"><span>1≤</span><span>得分</span><span>≤2</span></p></td></tr>
